---
Get job details

Usage: vendo jobs get [OPTIONS] <jobId>

Arguments:
  <jobId>  

Options:
      --json            Output raw JSON
      --profile <name>  Use a specific account profile
      --debug           Enable verbose request diagnostics
  -h, --help            Print help

Examples:
  $ vendo jobs get <jobId>
  $ vendo jobs get <jobId> --json
